</path></svg></span>Danger zone</h2><p class="mt-1 max-w-[60ch] text-sm text-muted-foreground">You have 6 seconds to undo each of these.</p></div></header><div class="border-y border-border"><div class="divide-y divide-border"><div data-kit-row="" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-2 py-4 md:items-center md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto]"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0"><span class="block text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Transfer ownership</span><p class="mt-0.5 max-w-[56ch] text-xs text-muted-foreground">Make someone else the owner. You become a member.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 md:justify-self-end"><button data-variant="outline" data-size="sm" aria-haspopup="dialog">Transfer</button></div></div><div data-kit-row="" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-2 py-4 md:items-center md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto]"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0"><span class="block text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Leave team</span><p class="mt-0.5 max-w-[56ch] text-xs text-muted-foreground">Make someone else the owner first.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 md:justify-self-end"><button data-variant="outline" data-size="sm" disabled="" aria-haspopup="dialog">Leave</button></div></div><div data-kit-row="" class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-2 py-4 md:items-center md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_auto]"><div class="min-w-0"><div class="min-w-0"><span class="block text-sm font-medium text-foreground">Delete team</span><p class="mt-0.5 max-w-[56ch] text-xs text-muted-foreground">Delete the team, its sites and everything in them.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 md:justify-self-end"><button data-variant="outline" data-size="sm" class="border-destructive/40 text-destructive hover:border-destructive/60 hover:bg-destructive/10 hover:text-destructive" aria-haspopup="dialog">Delete</button></div></div></div></div></section></div>"`;

exports[`the Team page with the team-names beta off: today's DOM, byte for byte > draws the remove dialog, its Undo bar and its failure words as today 1`] = `"<div role="dialog" aria-labelledby="_r_a_"><h3 id="_r_a_"><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span data-kit-icon="heading" class="flex shrink-0 text-destructive [&amp;_svg]:h-[18px] [&amp;_svg]:w-[18px]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M256,136a12,12,0,0,1-12,12H204a12,12,0,0,1,0-24h40A12,12,0,0,1,256,136Zm-54.81,56.28a12,12,0,1,1-18.38,15.44C169.12,191.42,145,172,108,172c-28.89,0-55.46,12.68-74.81,35.72a12,12,0,0,1-18.38-15.44A124.08,124.08,0,0,1,63.5,156.53a72,72,0,1,1,89,0A124,124,0,0,1,201.19,192.28ZM108,148a48,48,0,1,0-48-48A48.05,48.05,0,0,0,108,148Z"></path></svg></span>Remove Teammate 3f2a9c1b?</span></h3><div>Teammate 3f2a9c1b loses access to this team's sites and settings, and the AI assistants they connected stop working. API keys they made keep working. You have 6 seconds to undo; after that, they need a new invite to come back.</div><button type="button">Cancel</button><button type="button" data-hold-confirm="">Hold to remove</button></div>"`;

exports[`the Team page with the team-names beta off: today's DOM, byte for byte > draws the transfer picker as today, before and after a person is picked, and its Undo bar 1`] = `"<div role="dialog" aria-labelledby="_r_m_"><h3 id="_r_m_"><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span data-kit-icon="heading" class="flex shrink-0 text-destructive [&amp;_svg]:h-[18px] [&amp;_svg]:w-[18px]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M216.49,184.49l-32,32a12,12,0,0,1-17-17L179,188H48a12,12,0,0,1,0-24H179l-11.52-11.51a12,12,0,0,1,17-17l32,32A12,12,0,0,1,216.49,184.49Zm-145-64a12,12,0,0,0,17-17L77,92H208a12,12,0,0,0,0-24H77L88.49,56.49a12,12,0,0,0-17-17l-32,32a12,12,0,0,0,0,17Z"></path></svg></span>Transfer ownership?</span></h3><div>Pick who becomes the owner. You become a member: you still see every site's stats, but can no longer change settings or billing.</div><div class="space-y-1.5 border-t border-border pt-4"><label for="team-transfer-target" class="block text-sm font-medium text-foreground">New owner</label><select id="team-transfer-target"><option value="">Pick a person</option><option value="3f2a9c1b-6d0e-4a57-9b1c-2e8f7a6d5c41" title="Admin">Teammate 3f2a9c1b</option><option value="2f4e6d8a-1b3c-4d5e-8f7a-6c5b4a3d2e19" title="Admin">Teammate 2f4e6d8a</option><option value="7c1e2b9d-4f3a-4c8e-a1d2-9b6e5f4a3c27" title="Member">Teammate 7c1e2b9d</option><option value="8d4e1f60-7a2b-4c9d-b3e1-5f6a7b8c9d02" title="Member">Teammate 8d4e1f60</option></select></div><button type="button">Cancel</button><button type="button" data-hold-confirm="" disabled="">Hold to transfer</button></div>"`;

